# Page shell canon

Template project pages share one chrome: sidebar + topbar + `header()` + page lead + optional tabs/toolbar + body.

Spec page **Анатомия экрана**, route `#/lab/page`. Not in the product sidebar. Link only from **Все экраны**.

## When you add a new element to the template (not a one-off field)

If it appears on **section screens** assembled by `shell()` + `header()` (title, intro, menu, tabs slot, insight, etc.), add it to **`PAGE_SHELL_CANON`** in `js/screens-lab.js` in the same change:

- `id`, `title`, `slot` (selector or function)
- `design` — why it looks and sits there
- `product` — what it is for, what it is not

Also update the numbered schematic `pageSchematic()` so the numbers still match the catalog order.

Skip `PAGE_SHELL_CANON` for:

- Unique **entity cards** → `CARD_CANON` / `#/lab/cards`
- Fields on a **detail** screen (имя агента, токен интеграции)
- Auth, cover, create-wizard, account-only chrome (`accountShell`) unless you introduce a shared slot used by all project sections

Incomplete = new template chrome without a `PAGE_SHELL_CANON` row.
